# TypeScript / JavaScript

- **Strict mode**; prefer explicit types over `any`
- **Naming:** camelCase (vars/fns), PascalCase (classes/types), UPPER_SNAKE (constants/tokens), kebab-case (files and dirs)
- **JSDoc** on new public APIs (`@param`, `@returns`)
- **Errors:** fail fast with context; guard clauses at boundaries
- **Security:** sanitize inputs; never expose secrets in client code or logs; `process.env` is server-only

